TOUR\\\",\\\"prefetch\\\":false}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"FAQ\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/faq\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"prefetch\\\":false}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"RESOURCES\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/resources\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"RESOURCES\\\",\\\"prefetch\\\":false}]]]}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"CONTACT\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"footer-map-link\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"tel:+97142585754\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"footer-phone-link\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"+971 4 258 5754\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"footer-email-link\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"sales@brightluxx.com\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"site-footer__bottom\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"© \\\",2026,\\\" BRIGHTLUXX. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"A DIVISION OF IHG INDUSTRY L.L.C\\\"}]]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L8\\\",null,{}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L9\\\",null,{}]]}]}]]}],{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L5\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"forbidden\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"unauthorized\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]}],{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$La\\\",null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lb\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$2\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.MetadataOutlet\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$@c\\\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\\\"$d\\\"]},null,false,null],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"h\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Le\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$Lf\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L10\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$2\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L11\\\"}]}]}],null]}],false]],\\\"m\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"G\\\":[\\\"$12\\\",[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/29_hqtqdgnbf4.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]]],\\\"S\\\":true,\\\"h\\\":null,\\\"r\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"s\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"l\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"d\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"b\\\":\\\"J-V0ExL5uJNYMuZ_WdZhP\\\"}\\nd:C\\n13:Tdfe,{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"FAQPage\\\", \\\"mainEntity\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does AI enhance real-time content personalization in LED digital signage in the UAE?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"AI enables LED displays to analyze demographics, behavior, and even mood of viewers instantly, allowing content to be tailored specifically to the audience. In the UAE's diverse markets, this means retailers and advertisers can dynamically show relevant messages, improving engagement and conversion rates.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Why is AI-powered digital signage considered the future of smart displays in GCC countries?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"AI transforms LED displays from static screens into interactive, intelligent systems that deliver personalized content and predictive insights. In GCC countries like the UAE, with their tech-savvy populations and high retail competition, AI-powered signage offers a significant advantage by optimizing customer engagement and operational efficiency.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What are the cost implications of implementing AI-driven LED displays compared to traditional digital signage in Dubai?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"While AI-powered LED displays may involve higher initial investment due to advanced hardware and software integration, they deliver greater ROI through targeted advertising and efficient content management. In Dubai's competitive market, businesses often find the long-term benefits outweigh the upfront costs through increased customer interaction and sales.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How can AI-powered digital signage measure audience engagement more accurately in retail environments?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"AI uses sensors and computer vision to track audience size, dwell time, and reactions, providing real-time analytics. This data helps businesses in the GCC refine their marketing strategies, ensuring content resonates well with different demographics and boosts engagement rates effectively.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What role does predictive analytics play in optimizing LED display content in Gulf retail markets?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Predictive analytics leverages historical and contextual data, such as time of day and weather, to forecast peak engagement periods and preferred content types. This allows LED displays in Gulf retail spaces to pre-load relevant content, maximizing viewer attention and advertising impact.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Are AI-powered digital signage solutions customizable for different industries within the UAE and broader Middle East?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yes, AI-powered signage can be tailored to various sectors including retail, hospitality, transportation, and corporate environments across the UAE and GCC. Customization ensures content, analytics, and functionalities match industry-specific needs and cultural contexts for maximum effectiveness.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does implementing smart LED displays with AI technology improve brand communication in the GCC region?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Smart LED displays with AI enhance brand communication by delivering personalized, engaging, and timely messages that resonate with diverse GCC audiences. This leads to stronger customer connections, better brand recall, and increased sales opportunities in the competitive Middle Eastern markets.\\\"}}]}a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"legacy-page\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Article\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"headline\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AI-Powered Digital Signage: The Future of Smart Displays in 2026\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"How artificial intelligence is revolutionizing LED displays with real-time content personalization, audience analytics, and predictive engagement.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/ai-powered-digital-signage-2026\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/downloaded-images_blog_e223e2be_ai-powered-digital-s.jpg\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"datePublished\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-03-18\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dateModified\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-08-09\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"articleSection\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Display Technology\\\\\\\"}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],\\\"$L14\\\",\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\"],\\\"$L17\\\",\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Blog\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 3, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AI-Powered Digital Signage: The Future of Smart Displays in 2026\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/ai-powered-digital-signage-2026\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}]\\n15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"legalName\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:Tefd,\\u003ch1\\u003eAI-Powered Digital\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBlog — Ai Powered Digital Signage 2026. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eHow artificial intelligence is revolutionizing LED displays with real-time content personalization, audience analytics, and predictive engagement.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eThe AI Revolution in Digital Signage\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eArtificial intelligence is transforming LED displays from passive screens into intelligent communication systems. In 2026, AI-powered signage can analyze audiences in real-time, personalize content instantly, and measure engagement with unprecedented accuracy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eReal-Time Content Personalization\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eModern AI systems can detect audience demographics, mood, and behavior to deliver targeted content. A retail display might show sportswear to young adults in the morning and luxury accessories to professionals in the evening—all automatically.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003ePredictive Analytics\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAI analyzes historical data to predict peak engagement times, optimal content types, and even weather-based preferences. Displays can pre-load content that performs best under specific conditions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eAnonymous Audience Measurement\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003ePrivacy-compliant computer vision counts viewers, measures dwell time, and tracks attention—providing ROI metrics that were impossible with traditional signage.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eIntegration with Business Systems\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAI-powered displays connect to POS systems, inventory databases, and CRM platforms. Low stock? The display automatically promotes alternatives. New VIP customer nearby? Personalized welcome messages appear instantly.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eUAE/GCC Implementation\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSeveral Dubai malls have already deployed AI signage with impressive results: 35% increase in engagement, 22% improvement in conversion rates, and significantly better content ROI tracking.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eGetting Started\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAI capabilities can be added to existing LED displays through software upgrades and camera modules. Contact our team for a demonstration of AI-powered content management.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does AI enhance real-time content personalization in LED digital signage in the UAE?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAI enables LED displays to analyze demographics, behavior, and even mood of viewers instantly, allowing content to be tailored specifically to the audience. In the UAE's diverse markets, this means retailers and advertisers can dynamically show relevant messages, improving engagement and conversion rates.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy is AI-powered digital signage considered the future of smart displays in GCC countries?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAI transforms LED displays from static screens into interactive, intelligent systems that deliver personalized content and predictive insights. In GCC countries like the UAE, with their tech-savvy populations and high retail competition, AI-powered signage offers a significant advantage by optimizing customer engagement and operational efficiency.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the cost implications of implementing AI-driven LED displays compared to traditional digital signage in Dubai?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhile AI-powered LED displays may involve higher initial investment due to advanced hardware and software integration, they deliver greater ROI through targeted advertising and efficient content management. In Dubai's competitive market, businesses often find the long-term benefits outweigh the upfront costs through increased customer interaction and sales.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow can AI-powered digital signage measure audience engagement more accurately in retail environments?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAI uses sensors and computer vision to track audience size, dwell time, and reactions, providing real-time analytics. This data helps businesses in the GCC refine their marketing strategies, ensuring content resonates well with different demographics and boosts engagement rates effectively.\\u003c/p\\u003e17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"legacy-page__content\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\n18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"seo-content-block\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"seo-content-block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Specification guidance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"AI-Powered Digital\\\",\\\" — project planning\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"seo-content-block__copy\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Blog — Ai Powered Digital Signage 2026. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\\",\\\" Brightluxx helps teams translate viewing distance, ambient light, operating hours and site constraints into an LED display specification that can be installed, maintained and expanded with confidence.\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Start with the audience and environment, then confirm pixel pitch, brightness, processing, power access and serviceability. Our engineering team can review drawings, recommend a suitable display family and coordinate the practical requirements for delivery and commissioning.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"seo-content-block__links\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Related Brightluxx resources\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"/products\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/products\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"seo-internal-link-products\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Explore LED displays\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"→\\\"}]],\\\"prefetch\\\":false}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"/solutions\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/solutions\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"seo-internal-link-solutions\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Plan a solution\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"→\\\"}]],\\\"prefetch\\\":false}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"/resources\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/resources\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"seo-internal-link-resources\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Technical resources\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"→\\\"}]],\\\"prefetch\\\":false}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",\\\"/contact\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/contact\\\",\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"seo-internal-link-contact\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Talk to an engineer\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"→\\\"}]],\\\"prefetch\\\":false}]]}]]}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\